      "jp": "このままだと、雫は虚無に呑み込まれてしまう",
      "en_original": "As it was, the drops would eventually be swallowed up completely by nothingness.",
      "en_auxiliary": null,
      "en": "As it was, the drops would eventually be swallowed up completely by nothingness.",
