      "jp": "ユズとライムは、<CR>バラバラになってしまった雫を必死につなぎとめた",
      "en_original": "Lime and I struggled to bring together the scattered drops.",
      "en_auxiliary": null,
      "en": "Yuzu and Lime desperately held together the scattered droplets.",
      "alignment": {
        "status": "exact_index_msg_id",
