        "duration1": [],
        "msg_id": 2,
        "unknown2": 2,
        "duration2": [
          4294967295
        ]
      },
      "jp": "一度手を離せば、もう二度と取り戻せない……<CR>そんな予感があったから",
      "en_original": "I knew that if I let go for even an instant, I'd never get them back.",
      "en_auxiliary": null,
      "en": "I knew that if I let go for even an instant, I'd never get them back.",
      "alignment": {
        "status": "exact_index_msg_id",
